s accepts a length | not applicable | [ ] |\n# Configuration Surface\n\n## Build-Time Configurations\n\n`Cargo.toml` has no `[features]` table, and `c_src/CMakeLists.txt` has no\n`option`, conditional source, compile definition, or preprocessor-controlled\nbackend. There is exactly one valid feature combination:\n\n| # | Cargo invocation | CMake configuration | [ ] |\n|---|------------------|---------------------|-----|\n| B1 | `--no-default-features` (empty feature set) | default, PIC enabled | [ ] |\n\n## Runtime and Input Configurations\n\nThe rows below come from the comparisons, switches, and composed call graph in\n`c_src/src/lib.c`. IEEE-754 special values are included where C comparisons\nroute them differently. Invalid-input rejection rows are in `ERRORS.md`.\n\n| # | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | [ ] |\n|---|----------------|-------------------------------------------|-----|\n| 1 | `c2V` | arbitrary finite and IEEE-754-special `x`, `y`; values are copied | [ ] |\n| 2 | `c2Maxv` | each component has `a > b` | [ ] |\n| 3 | `c2Maxv` | each component has `a <= b` | [ ] |\n| 4 | `c2Maxv` | mixed component comparison outcomes | [ ] |\n| 5 | `c2Maxv` | either operand is NaN, making the C comparison false | [ ] |\n| 6 | `c2Minv` | each component has `a < b` | [ ] |\n| 7 | `c2Minv` | each component has `a >= b` | [ ] |\n| 8 | `c2Minv` | mixed component comparison outcomes | [ ] |\n| 9 | `c2Minv` | either operand is NaN, making the C comparison false | [ ] |\n| 10 | `c2Clampv` | each component of `a` is below `lo` | [ ] |\n| 11 | `c2Clampv` | each component of `a` is within `[lo, hi]` | [ ] |\n| 12 | `c2Clampv` | each component of `a` is above `hi` | [ ] |\n| 13 | `c2Clampv` | components occupy different below/inside/above regions | [ ] |\n| 14 | `c2Clampv` | NaN in `a`, `lo`, or `hi` exercises false comparisons | [ ] |\n| 15 | `c2Sub`, `c2Dot` | finite vectors, including zero and mixed signs | [ ] |\n| 16 | `c2Sub`, `c2Dot` | infiniti